<title>UK: TABLE - C&amp;W pretax rises 12 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE - C&amp;W pretax rises 12 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		30.3		   vs  27.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  7.7		   vs   6.92</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 11.1		   vs  10.0</p>
<p> Pretax		    1,418		   vs 1,341</p>
<p> Turnover		  7,002		   vs 6,172</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 1,325.0 and 1,400 million stg.</p>
<p>The company said the results included increased losses in associated undertakings mainly as a result of including Vebacom GmbH losses for a full year of 93 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Cable &amp; Wireless Plc</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
